asureAlgebra}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11MeasureAlgebra}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure11\\text{-}measure\\text{-}algebra} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11MeasureAlgebra}_S(\\mathbb B,\\Sigma,\\mu,E)\\leftrightarrow \\exists X\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\Sigma)\\land E=\\{\\langle A,B\\rangle\\in\\Sigma\\times\\Sigma\\mid\\mu((A\\setminus B)\\cup(B\\setminus A))=0\\}\\land\\mathbb B=\\left\\{\\{B\\in\\Sigma\\mid\\mu((A\\setminus B)\\cup(B\\setminus A))=0\\}\\mid A\\in\\Sigma\\right\\}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure11\\text{-}measure\\text{-}algebra} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11MeasureAlgebra}_S(\\mathbb B,\\Sigma,\\mu,E)\\leftrightarrow \\exists X\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\Sigma)\\land E=\\{\\langle A,B\\rangle\\in\\Sigma\\times\\Sigma\\mid\\mu((A\\setminus B)\\cup(B\\setminus A))=0\\}\\land\\mathbb B=\\left\\{\\{B\\in\\Sigma\\mid\\mu((A\\setminus B)\\cup(B\\setminus A))=0\\}\\mid A\\in\\Sigma\\right\\}\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Both the null-equivalence relation and each equivalence class are expanded over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span>; no undeclared quotient-class or symmetric-difference operator remains.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false